  "historical_reading": "The two contemporary works name J. K. K. Apartments at 956–962 Route Bourgeat. The 1942 street listing also records units 1B and 3A. These are period addresses. They are insufficient to assign historical apartment numbers to present doors in Lane 962.",
  "coverage": "The building is documented by 1937. The 1937 street directory prints 956–8 for the apartments and lists 962 separately. In 1941 and 1942 the apartment listing spans 956–962. The records give different address ranges and do not establish a construction or alteration date, floor plan or present unit boundaries."
